Let $\textbf{y} = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
      4 \\
      8 \\
      1
      \end{array} \right\rbrack$, $\mathbf{u}_{1} = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
      {2\text{/}3} \\
